---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
import heroPhoto from '../assets/hero-industrial.jpeg';
---

<section
  id="inicio"
  class="relative flex min-h-svh items-center overflow-hidden bg-ink-900"
>
  <!--
    The hero image is the page's largest paint, so it is eager with a high
    fetch priority. The slow drift comes from CSS and pauses under
    prefers-reduced-motion.
  -->
  <Image
    src={heroPhoto}
    alt=""
    widths={[768, 1280, 1920]}
    sizes="100vw"
    format="webp"
    quality={78}
    loading="eager"
    fetchpriority="high"
    decoding="async"
    class="hero-photo absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center contrast-[1.08] saturate-[1.1]"
  />

  <!-- Even base wash. Heavier on small screens, where the copy spans the full
       width and cannot rely on a side gradient. -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-ink-950/22 sm:bg-ink-950/16"></div>

  <!-- Darkens only the left column, behind the headline. The right side stays
       close to the photograph's own brightness. -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 hidden bg-linear-to-r from-ink-950/85 from-5% via-ink-950/28 via-50% to-transparent sm:block"
  >
  </div>

  <!-- Grounds the copy at the bottom edge. -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-ink-950/90 via-ink-950/22 via-42% to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="blueprint absolute inset-0 opacity-25"></div>

  <div class="copy-on-photo shell relative z-10 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-invert animate-reveal reveal-fade max-w-md sm:max-w-none">
      Limpieza y mantención de tuberías y superficies
    </p>

    <h1
      class="animate-reveal reveal-clip mt-5 max-w-3xl font-display text-[clamp(2.1rem,5.5vw,4rem)] font-bold leading-[1.06] text-white"
      style="--reveal-delay:90ms"
    >
      La limpieza profesional que tu empresa necesita
    </h1>

    <p
      class="animate-reveal mt-5 max-w-2xl border-l-2 border-accent-500 pl-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-200 sm:text-lg"
      style="--reveal-delay:220ms"
    >
      En un entorno industrial, la limpieza no es un detalle: es seguridad, eficiencia y confianza.
      Entregamos soluciones profesionales para mantener tus espacios en las mejores condiciones.
    </p>

    <div
      class="animate-reveal mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 sm:mt-9"
      style="--reveal-delay:320ms"
    >
      <a
        href={site.whatsapp}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="btn-sweep inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-md bg-accent-500 px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <Icon name="whatsapp" class="h-5 w-5" />
        Solicitar cotización
      </a>
      <a
        href="#servicios"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-md border border-white/25 px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white transition duration-300 hover:border-white/60 hover:bg-white/10"
      >
        Ver servicios
        <Icon
          name="arrow-right"
          class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
        />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a
    href="#compromiso"
    class="group absolute bottom-8 right-8 z-10 hidden h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/25 text-white transition hover:border-white/60 hover:bg-white/10 lg:inline-flex"
    aria-label="Ir a la siguiente sección"
  >
    <Icon
      name="arrow-down"
      class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-1"
    />
  </a>
</section>
